  "description": "TO LET – 2 BEDROOM HOME\n\n80 O'Dwyer Villas, Thomondgate, Limerick\n\nJohn Giltinane & Associates are pleased to offer this 2-bedroom house to rent, ideally located in the established residential area of O'Dwyer Villas, Thomondgate, Limerick.\n\nThe property offers comfortable accommodation and is conveniently situated close to Limerick City Centre, with a range of local amenities, shops, schools and public transport options within easy reach.\n\nProperty Features : \n2 Bedrooms\nSitting Room\nKitchen\nBathroom\nRear outdoor area\nLocation\n\n80 O'Dwyer Villas is located in Thomondgate, just a short distance from Limerick City Centre and within easy access of the North Circular Road and surrounding areas.\n\nViewing is strictly by appointment.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact John Giltinane & Associates.\n**WE WELCOME HOMEHAK TENANT CV's FOR ALL OF OUR PROPERTIES***",
